      "value": "I've been hoping for something like this, yeah -- it would mean that if you're using something like OBS to stream your desktop to others, instead of putting up with the lag involved in watching your own OBS feed, you could (via some Udon designed for handling this case) locally watch your localhost Spout stream instead",
