  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2026-10-31T18:47:41.530Z",
  "deleteID": null,
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Hello, It would be amazing to see spout receiver for World SDK which would allow to you get instant video ingame for \"localhost\" purposes which could help in case of people doing such things as vjing to control visuals for clubs or etc to see them ingame already being applied without using stuff as like local RSTP/RTMP streams for it while we could just in world select which spout receiver we want to use.\n\nIm mostly thinking that the component should have RenderTexture which we assign and methods as like:\n\nstring[] GetSpoutSources();\n\nvoid SetSpoutSource(string sourceName = \"Arena - Screen\"); etc",
